## Common Policy Libraries

HashiCorp maintains several policy libraries:
- `CIS-Policy-Set-for-AWS-Terraform` - CIS benchmarks for AWS
- `aws-networking-terraform` - AWS networking policies
- `gcp-compute-terraform` - GCP compute policies
- `azure-storage-terraform` - Azure storage policies
